{"id":"n17236-1-21","stage":1,"title":"검사 · 检查","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n17236-1-21-1","ko":"위에 염증이 생겼는지 계속 배가 아파요.","zh":"肚子一直疼，可能是胃发炎了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"위에","meaning":"胃","explanation":"위：胃；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"위","audio":"/audio/e0bebb354d8f7f3b0c82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26726","senseId":"1","lemma":"위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"위에","audio":"/audio/045b71d3898d7969a90d.mp3"}},{"text":"염증이","meaning":"炎症","explanation":"염증：炎症；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"염증","audio":"/audio/a1e58110b56c1d8af863.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67648","senseId":"1","lemma":"염증","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"염증이","audio":"/audio/971d9069b60646547040.mp3"}},{"text":"생겼는지","meaning":"发生，产生","explanation":"생기다：发生，产生；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67898","senseId":"3","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생겼는지","audio":"/audio/fed1cee1a45108dfc90b.mp3"}},{"text":"계속","meaning":"继续，持续","explanation":"계속：继续，持续","readings":[{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17692","senseId":"1","lemma":"계속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}},{"text":"배가","meaning":"腹部","explanation":"배：腹部；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"배","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20211","senseId":"2","lemma":"배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배가","audio":"/audio/c5a9b1ff55fc80e6120e.mp3"}},{"text":"아파요.","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아파요","audio":"/audio/0d77fc96982cfc284c03.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e0bebb354d8f7f3b","term":"위","zh":"胃","audio":"/audio/e0bebb354d8f7f3b0c82.mp3","entryId":"26726","definition":"动物或人的体内负责消化功能的器官。","pronunciation":["위"]},{"id":"a1e58110b56c1d8a","term":"염증","zh":"炎症","audio":"/audio/a1e58110b56c1d8af863.mp3","entryId":"67648","definition":"生物体受伤时的反应，红肿或发烧，疼痛的症状。","pronunciation":["염쯩"]},{"id":"fc2a5a2e23bd6357","term":"생기다","zh":"发生，产生","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3","entryId":"67898","definition":"出现事故或事情、问题等。","pronunciation":["생기다"]},{"id":"23a9f0224cc40ec0","term":"계속","zh":"继续，持续","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3","entryId":"17692","definition":"连续不间断。","pronunciation":["계ː속","게ː속"]},{"id":"3d0af87e12fd988a","term":"배","zh":"腹部","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3","entryId":"20211","definition":"人或动物的身体中消化食物的肠胃等内脏所在的部位。","pronunciation":["배"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c0f6e73ea60072258522.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n17236-1-21-2","ko":"병원에 가서 자세히 검사를 받아 보도록 해.","zh":"去医院仔细检查一下吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"병원에","meaning":"医院","explanation":"병원：医院；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"병원","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62271","senseId":"1","lemma":"병원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"병원에","audio":"/audio/2610e1319b7ca0517a20.mp3"}},{"text":"가서","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가서","audio":"/audio/0a4296790d3f4b0e6e6b.mp3"}},{"text":"자세히","meaning":"仔细地，详细地","explanation":"자세히：仔细地，详细地","readings":[{"term":"자세히","audio":"/audio/a072ebb77d96a16624a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71196","senseId":"1","lemma":"자세히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자세히","audio":"/audio/a072ebb77d96a16624a4.mp3"}},{"text":"검사를","meaning":"检查","explanation":"검사：检查；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"검사","audio":"/audio/cf57fb29da3118185a06.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17236","senseId":"1","lemma":"검사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"검사를","audio":"/audio/ea8da3017e61dec99150.mp3"}},{"text":"받아","meaning":"接，接受","explanation":"받다：接，接受；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"9","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"받아","audio":"/audio/0a0a7a563f5137f6e18d.mp3"}},{"text":"보도록","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；도록：表示目的、达到的程度或促使某事发生。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"5","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보도록","audio":"/audio/84ee47fcd0b9f411fb2c.mp3"}},{"text":"해.","meaning":"表示应当。","explanation":"하다：表示应当。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4f4c2d79c47ca512","term":"병원","zh":"医院","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3","entryId":"62271","definition":"具备相关设施、由医生和护士治疗病人的地方。","pronunciation":["병ː원"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"a072ebb77d96a166","term":"자세히","zh":"仔细地，详细地","audio":"/audio/a072ebb77d96a16624a4.mp3","entryId":"71196","definition":"连很细小的部分都具体而明确地。","pronunciation":["자세히"]},{"id":"cf57fb29da311818","term":"검사","zh":"检查","audio":"/audio/cf57fb29da3118185a06.mp3","entryId":"17236","definition":"调查某事或某个对象，从而判断其对错、好坏。","pronunciation":["검사"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"接，接受","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"受到要求、申请、提问、攻击或信号等的作用，或指对这些做出反应。","pronunciation":["받따"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示应当。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"表示应当。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fe7893abb341c127790e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.925,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=17236","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":56,"sequenceScore":2.4771,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["去医院仔细检查一下吧。","肚子一直疼，可能是胃发炎了。","妈妈，剪刀在哪儿呢？我明天上美术课要用。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["肚子一直疼，可能是胃发炎了。","妈妈，剪刀在哪儿呢？我明天上美术课要用。","去医院仔细检查一下吧。"],"answer":2}]}
